  "subtitle": "Main flow: choose an eligible product → create and audit affiliate link → show short URL.",
  "classNote": "Scope: ordinary KOL link creation. DTO, AuditLog, campaign/deal models and imported code-generation helpers are described in FR10_CODE_ANALYSIS.md.",
  "notes": [
    "Browser = ReferralLinksPage + HTTP adapter. JWT/role/DTO checks precede controller calls; collaboratorId comes from JWT. Campaign invitation loading is a separate request.",
    "Quota counts are read before the transaction: 10 links/minute, 500 ACTIVE links, 20 non-deleted links/product. Optional campaign/deal checks and failures are documented separately.",
    "Prisma P2002 retries the write with a new code/UUID, at most 5 attempts. Coupon is stored as a string; QR rendering, click tracking and checkout are separate interactions."
  ],
